  "text": "Aspect celestial\n\nPrerequisites The relic is a weapon.\n\nActivate 2 command\n\n---\n\nEffect Drawing upon divine fury, you single out a target that damaged you or an ally within the past round and fill your relic with divine vengeance against them. Make a Strike against that foe, dealing an additional damage die on a hit. If the target is evil, it is also Enfeebled 1 until the start of your next turn on a hit (or Enfeebled 2 on a critical hit).",
